WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.072 --> 00:00:02.530
RYAN MATSUMOTO: Today, we're
talking about the Google Cloud

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:06.290
2021 Summit Series and some
exciting news for data lovers.

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:08.530
I'm Ryan, and welcome
to This Week in Cloud,

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:11.780
where we serve you the
lowest latency news.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.870
The Google Cloud 2021 Summit
Series kicked off last week

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.610
with Data Cloud, Financial
Services, and Applied Online

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:18.110
ML.

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:20.570
Up next is the Digital
Manufacturers Summit,

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:23.540
and we've got even more in store
for you throughout the summer.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.460
Be sure to bookmark the
Summit Series website

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.630
and register for free today.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.180
We are excited to announce
Dataplex, an intelligent data

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.830
fabric that provides a way
to centrally manage, monitor,

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:36.040
and govern your data
across data lakes, data

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.780
warehouses, and
data marts and make

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.870
this data securely accessible to
a variety of analytics and data

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.340
science tools.

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:45.113
Dataplex provides an integrated
analytics experience,

00:00:45.113 --> 00:00:47.530
bringing together the best of
Google Cloud and open source

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:51.490
tools so you can rapidly curate,
secure, integrate, and analyze

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:54.300
data at scale.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.465
Dataflow is a no-op, serverless
data processing platform

00:00:57.465 --> 00:01:00.090
that enables you to collect and
enrich the vast amounts of data

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:02.460
that your applications
and users generate.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:05.550
We've built Dataflow Prime to
bring unparalleled resource

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:08.220
utilization and radical
operational simplicity

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.080
to big data processing.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.120
Dataflow Prime allows
you to get more done

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:15.180
with less by eliminating the
time you spend sizing resource

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:18.270
needs, optimizing resource
usage to save costs,

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:20.130
and increasing
your productivity.

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:21.690
Check out the
preview in early Q3.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:26.190
For anyone who's found
sharing and exchanging

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:28.560
data to be a challenge,
we're excited to introduce

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:31.080
Analytics Hub, a new
fully-managed service

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:33.450
available Q3 in
preview that helps

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:35.250
you unlock the value
of data sharing,

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.190
leading to new insights and
increased business value.

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:41.177
Check out the blog for a full
list of capabilities today.

00:01:41.177 --> 00:01:43.260
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:45.700
or see the full list,
check out the link.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.010
Any thoughts or ideas?

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:48.700
Leave us a comment or tweet us.

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:51.080
We'll see you in the Cloud.

